{"unit_id":"Boliban__dsh-enter-customizer#card-zh","repo":"Boliban/dsh-enter-customizer","commit":"44f4ac629ec41374b4446479b7baddf2dda7f746","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Enter Customizer 是一款 DSH 网页插件，可在聊天输入框自定义 Enter、Ctrl+Enter、Shift+Enter、Alt+Enter 和发送按钮的行为。它在输入区域接管按键，并提供系统设置页；每个快捷键可选择发送、繁忙时排队、插入换行或不处理，发送按钮可选择发送、排队或不处理。配置保存在用户设置中，适合希望调整消息提交习惯的 DSH Web 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:293-345","lib/index.js:17-35"]}
{"unit_id":"Boliban__dsh-enter-customizer#card-en","repo":"Boliban/dsh-enter-customizer","commit":"44f4ac629ec41374b4446479b7baddf2dda7f746","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Enter Customizer is a DSH web plugin for configuring Enter, Ctrl+Enter, Shift+Enter, Alt+Enter, and send-button behavior. Its settings page lets each key send, queue a message, insert a newline, or do nothing; the button can send, queue, or do nothing. Settings persist in DSH user settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:177-245","lib/client.js:293-345","lib/index.js:31-35"]}
