{"unit_id":"Boliban__dsh-enter-customizer#feature-1","repo":"Boliban/dsh-enter-customizer","commit":"44f4ac629ec41374b4446479b7baddf2dda7f746","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Enter Customizer 的功能「快捷键行为」：为 Enter、Ctrl+Enter、Shift+Enter、Alt+Enter 分别选择发送、繁忙时排队、换行或无作用；只处理符合条件的普通文本草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:177-212"]}
{"unit_id":"Boliban__dsh-enter-customizer#feature-2","repo":"Boliban/dsh-enter-customizer","commit":"44f4ac629ec41374b4446479b7baddf2dda7f746","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Enter Customizer 的功能「发送按钮配置」：可为输入框发送按钮选择发送、繁忙时排队或无作用。点击仅在聊天输入区域对应的按钮且草稿符合处理条件时接管。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:214-235"]}
{"unit_id":"Boliban__dsh-enter-customizer#feature-3","repo":"Boliban/dsh-enter-customizer","commit":"44f4ac629ec41374b4446479b7baddf2dda7f746","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Enter Customizer 的功能「持久化设置」：在系统「输入快捷键」页面启用或关闭接管、修改各项行为并恢复默认；设置通过 settingsScope 与 Host 注册的命名空间同步。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:78-110"]}
{"unit_id":"Boliban__dsh-enter-customizer#feature-4","repo":"Boliban/dsh-enter-customizer","commit":"44f4ac629ec41374b4446479b7baddf2dda7f746","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Enter Customizer 的功能「发送失败提示」：提交消息失败时在输入区上方显示错误提示，并在约 3.2 秒后自动清除；异常时也会尽量恢复原草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:156-173","lib/client.js:248-252"]}
